thag2.27:2.4 starts: his son.
thig6.8:6.2 starts: with rapture & pleasure.
sn12.31:2.4 starts: tell me their manner of life.’
sn12.31:5.4 starts: are asked this, tell me their manner of life.’
sn12.31:9.4 starts: tell me their manner of life.’”
